      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## AI Empire · Krea 2 Turbo realism\n\n**1 · LoRAs** (once): JupyterLab (port 8888) → `models/loras/` → upload:\n- your character LoRA, plus `skindetails_krea2_loraholic.safetensors` and `RawGirlV2_epoch_10.safetensors`.\nPress **R** in ComfyUI, then pick your file in **Your LoRA** (strength **1.0**).\n\n**2 · Prompt**, 3 blocks:\n- **who:** trigger word + hair and eyes (`zvx woman, long straight red hair, green eyes`)\n- **the shot:** pose, outfit, props, place, light, where she looks. Plain sentences, like describing a photo.\n- **the look:** `casual amateur shot iphone`\n\n**3 · Run.** Saved to `output/` as JPEG with no workflow inside. The slider shows raw vs finished.\n\n**Size:** 9:16 at 2 MP. Change the ratio in **Resolution**.\n**GPU:** 24 GB+ (4090, 3090, 5090, A5000 and up).\n\n**Models** (the pod downloads them with `KREA_TURBO=1`)\n- diffusion_models: [krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n- text_encoders: [qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n- vae: [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors)"
      ],
      "title": "READ ME"
    },
